msgid "GNU coreutils 与 BusyBox"
msgstr "GNU coreutils and BusyBox"

msgid "命令与文件归属"
msgstr "Commands and File Ownership"

msgid ""
"系统安装锁定的 GNU coreutils 9.12 全部 109 个命令入口，包括 ``[``、 "
"``test``、``arch``、``hostname``、``kill``、``uptime`` 与 ``coreutils`` "
"分发器。完整清单位于源码 ``userland/coreutils/programs.list``，构建时与 "
"锁定上游归档的程序清单比较，缺失任意入口或辅助库都会使构建失败。"
msgstr ""
"The system installs all 109 command entry points from the pinned GNU "
"coreutils 9.12, including ``[``, ``test``, ``arch``, ``hostname``, ``kill``,"
" ``uptime``, and the ``coreutils`` dispatcher. The complete list is in "
"``userland/coreutils/programs.list`` in the source tree. At build time it is"
" compared with the program list in the pinned upstream archive; any missing "
"entry point or helper library causes the build to fail."

msgid ""
"``/usr/bin/coreutils`` 是实际 ELF，其余 GNU 入口使用上游 single-binary symlink "
"模式指向它。``stdbuf`` 的预加载库安装在 "
"``/usr/libexec/coreutils/libstdbuf.so``；程序、链接、文档和许可证由 ``reliefos-coreutils``"
" APK 管理。"
msgstr ""
"``/usr/bin/coreutils`` is the actual ELF binary; the other GNU entry points "
"use upstream single-binary symlinks pointing to it. The preload library for "
"``stdbuf`` is installed at ``/usr/libexec/coreutils/libstdbuf.so``. "
"Programs, links, documentation, and licenses are managed by the ``reliefos-"
"coreutils`` APK."

msgid ""
"根文件系统没有合并 ``/bin`` 与 ``/usr/bin``。原先由 BusyBox 提供的 "
"``/bin/cat``、``/bin/cp``、``/usr/sbin/chroot`` 等旧路径保留为指向 GNU 入口的相对链接，并转交同一个 "
"coreutils 包。链接生成阶段不会再为同名 GNU 命令生成 BusyBox 入口。其他命令与 BusyBox 的 "
"``sh``、启动及救援功能保持可用。"
msgstr ""
"The root filesystem does not merge ``/bin`` and ``/usr/bin``. Legacy paths "
"formerly supplied by BusyBox, such as ``/bin/cat``, ``/bin/cp``, and "
"``/usr/sbin/chroot``, remain as relative links to GNU entry points and are "
"transferred to the same coreutils package. Link generation no longer creates"
" BusyBox entry points for GNU commands of the same name. Other commands and "
"BusyBox's ``sh``, boot, and rescue functions remain available."

msgid "在终端中检查外部入口和 APK 归属::"
msgstr "Check external entry points and APK ownership in a terminal::"

msgid ""
"``echo``、``printf``、``test``、``pwd`` 等名称也可能是 Bash/ash 内建命令。 需要明确调用 GNU 版本时使用"
" ``/usr/bin/printf`` 等绝对路径。显式 ``/bin/busybox NAME`` 仍调用 BusyBox "
"applet；更新和救援脚本需要此入口。 不要用 ``busybox --install`` 覆盖系统已经登记的文件。"
msgstr ""
"Names such as ``echo``, ``printf``, ``test``, and ``pwd`` may also refer to "
"Bash/ash builtins. Use absolute paths such as ``/usr/bin/printf`` to "
"explicitly invoke the GNU version. Explicit ``/bin/busybox NAME`` still "
"invokes a BusyBox applet; update and rescue scripts need this entry point. "
"Do not use ``busybox --install`` to overwrite files already registered by "
"the system."

msgid "升级与兼容性"
msgstr "Upgrades and Compatibility"

msgid ""
"新的 BusyBox 包依赖 ``reliefos-coreutils``，GNU 包声明接管旧 BusyBox 包的 重叠文件，使 APK "
"在正常事务中转移所有权，无需强制覆盖。不要手工删除 BusyBox ELF 或剥离它的内置 applet；显式救援调用仍依赖它们。 发行包与 "
"Alpine 的 ``coreutils``、``coreutils-single`` 声明冲突，避免两个 包同时提供 GNU 入口。使用系统的 "
"``reliefos-coreutils`` 包进行更新。"
msgstr ""
"The new BusyBox package depends on ``reliefos-coreutils``, and the GNU "
"package declares that it takes over overlapping files from the old BusyBox "
"package, allowing APK to transfer ownership in normal transactions without "
"forced overwrites. Do not manually delete the BusyBox ELF or strip its "
"built-in applets; explicit rescue calls still depend on them. The "
"distribution package declares conflicts with Alpine's ``coreutils`` and "
"``coreutils-single`` to prevent two packages from supplying the GNU entry "
"points simultaneously. Update using the system's ``reliefos-coreutils`` "
"package."

msgid ""
"GNU 与 BusyBox 的选项集合不完全相同。例如 GNU ``hostname`` 接受主机名参数， 不支持 BusyBox 的 "
"``-F``。系统初始化对现有主机名文件的读取显式使用 ``/bin/busybox hostname -F "
"/etc/hostname``；自定义脚本也应选择正确的实现。"
msgstr ""
"GNU and BusyBox do not support exactly the same options. For example, GNU "
"``hostname`` accepts a hostname argument but does not support BusyBox's "
"``-F``. System initialization explicitly uses ``/bin/busybox hostname -F "
"/etc/hostname`` to read the existing hostname file; custom scripts should "
"likewise choose the appropriate implementation."

msgid "终端颜色"
msgstr "Terminal Colors"

msgid ""
"交互式 Bash 通过 ``/etc/bash/colors.sh`` 为 ``ls``、``dir``、``vdir`` 设置 "
"``--color=auto`` 别名，文件类型和扩展名颜色使用 GNU ``dircolors`` 的默认数据库。配置由系统 bashrc "
"加载，新账户和已有账户均在重新打开 终端后生效；当前终端也可执行 ``. /etc/bash/colors.sh``。"
msgstr ""
"Interactive Bash sets ``--color=auto`` aliases for ``ls``, ``dir``, and "
"``vdir`` through ``/etc/bash/colors.sh``. File-type and extension colors use"
" GNU ``dircolors``' default database. The system bashrc loads this "
"configuration; it takes effect for both new and existing accounts when a new"
" terminal is opened. To apply it in the current terminal, run ``. "
"/etc/bash/colors.sh``."

msgid ""
"自动模式只在命令输出到终端时着色，管道和文件重定向保持纯文本。 非交互脚本不加载这些别名；``command ls`` 或 "
"``/usr/bin/ls`` 可以直接 调用外部命令，``ls --color=never`` 可关闭本次输出的颜色。"
msgstr ""
"Automatic mode adds colors only when output goes to a terminal; pipes and "
"file redirection retain plain text. Noninteractive scripts do not load these"
" aliases. Use ``command ls`` or ``/usr/bin/ls`` to call the external command"
" directly, or ``ls --color=never`` to disable colors for that invocation."

msgid ""
"已有的 ``LS_COLORS``、``LESS``、同名别名和函数不会被覆盖。 未设置 ``LESS`` 时使用 ``-R``，允许分页器显示 "
"ANSI 颜色。 启动 shell 前设置 ``TERM=dumb``、不设置终端类型或设置非空 ``NO_COLOR`` 会跳过默认颜色配置。GNU "
"9.12 的帮助包含超链接控制序列，当前 st 不支持该扩展； 可用 ``TERM=dumb ls --help | less`` "
"查看纯文本帮助，其他命令的颜色不受影响。"
msgstr ""
"Existing ``LS_COLORS``, ``LESS``, and aliases or functions of the same names"
" are not overwritten. If ``LESS`` is unset, ``-R`` is used to allow the "
"pager to display ANSI colors. Setting ``TERM=dumb``, leaving the terminal "
"type unset, or setting a nonempty ``NO_COLOR`` before starting the shell "
"skips the default color configuration. GNU 9.12 help includes hyperlink "
"control sequences, an extension not currently supported by st. Use "
"``TERM=dumb ls --help | less`` for plain-text help without affecting the "
"colors of other commands."

msgid ""
"``fdisk``、``sfdisk`` 保持 util-linux 原有的自动颜色及 ``terminal-colors.d`` 用户配置。本镜像中的"
" ``grep``、``diff``、``tree``、 ``dmesg`` 和 ``cal`` 为 BusyBox 实现，没有实际着色功能；不为其添加"
" 无效选项，也不强制为纯文本工具插入转义序列。"
msgstr ""
"``fdisk`` and ``sfdisk`` retain util-linux's original automatic colors and "
"``terminal-colors.d`` user configuration. In this image, ``grep``, ``diff``,"
" ``tree``, ``dmesg``, and ``cal`` are BusyBox implementations without actual"
" coloring support. No ineffective options are added to them, and escape "
"sequences are not forcibly inserted into plain-text tools."

msgid "功能边界"
msgstr "Functional Boundaries"

msgid ""
"启用所有命令入口不代表内核实现所有扩展。``chcon`` 和 ``runcon`` 使用 上游没有 libselinux 时的实现，对实际 "
"SELinux 操作返回失败；ReliefNT 当前 不提供 SELinux。不能把这两个命令能够显示版本解释为安全上下文操作可用。"
msgstr ""
"Enabling every command entry point does not mean that the kernel implements "
"every extension. ``chcon`` and ``runcon`` use upstream's implementation for "
"builds without libselinux and fail on actual SELinux operations; ReliefNT "
"currently provides no SELinux support. The ability of these commands to "
"display version information must not be taken to mean that security context "
"operations are available."

msgid ""
"本构建保持禁用 NLS、ACL 和扩展属性集成。普通权限、用户/组、文件操作、文本、 编码、校验和等使用真实 GNU "
"实现；依赖具体文件系统、设备或内核功能的选项， 仍以实际系统支持及命令退出码为准。"
msgstr ""
"This build keeps NLS, ACL, and extended-attribute integration disabled. "
"Standard permissions, users/groups, file operations, text, encoding, and "
"checksums use genuine GNU implementations. Options that depend on particular"
" filesystems, devices, or kernel features remain subject to actual system "
"support and command exit status."

msgid ""
"目标代码使用 x86-64 的 x87/SSE 基线。可选的 CPU 分发 CRC 后端会引入宿主 compiler-rt 的预编译 CPU "
"检测构造函数，该函数的 ISA 不受目标 ``-mno-avx`` 约束，因此交叉构建使用上游通用 CRC 路径。此设置保留 CRC 计算功能， "
"也避免在尚未保存 AVX 状态的内核中执行 AVX 指令。"
msgstr ""
"Target code uses the x86-64 x87/SSE baseline. The optional CPU-dispatched "
"CRC backend introduces a precompiled CPU-detection constructor from the host"
" compiler-rt, whose ISA is not constrained by the target's ``-mno-avx``. "
"Cross-builds therefore use upstream's generic CRC path. This preserves CRC "
"calculation while avoiding AVX instructions in a kernel that does not yet "
"save AVX state."

msgid "验收与测速"
msgstr "Acceptance Testing and Benchmarks"

msgid ""
"``tools/test_coreutils_qemu.py`` 使用完整生产 VMDK 的私有副本启动 ReliefOS， "
"仅注入用户态测试程序、数据和 OpenRC 测试服务，不替换生产内核、libc 或 GNU 程序。它核对镜像内 ELF "
"与构建产物的哈希，并在结束后核对原始 VMDK 未修改。"
msgstr ""
"``tools/test_coreutils_qemu.py`` boots ReliefOS from a private copy of the "
"complete production VMDK. It injects only userspace test programs, data, and"
" an OpenRC test service, without replacing the production kernel, libc, or "
"GNU programs. It compares ELF hashes in the image with build artifacts and "
"verifies afterward that the original VMDK is unchanged."

msgid ""
"来宾测试逐个验证 109 个命令入口和实际行为，包括退出码、文件内容、权限、 链接、文本转换、编码、散列、终端与进程工具。SELinux "
"两项单独记录为预期 不支持；同时查询真实 APK 数据库确认 GNU 路径归属，检查显式 BusyBox 救援调用。 这不是全部 GNU "
"上游测试或全部选项组合的替代品。"
msgstr ""
"Guest tests verify all 109 command entry points and their actual behavior "
"individually, including exit codes, file contents, permissions, links, text "
"transformations, encodings, hashes, and terminal and process tools. The two "
"SELinux commands are recorded separately as expected unsupported cases. "
"Tests also query the real APK database to verify ownership of GNU paths and "
"check explicit BusyBox rescue calls. This does not replace the full GNU "
"upstream test suite or every combination of options."

msgid "使用同一优化级别比较两种实现，例如使用 release 构建::"
msgstr ""
"Compare the two implementations at the same optimization level, for example "
"with a release build::"

msgid ""
"验收虚拟机使用 1 个 vCPU、4 GiB 内存，并显式提供 invariant TSC。 当前内核仅在单 CPU 条件下启用可信 TSC "
"高精度计时，多核回退的 PIT 计时 可能漏算长时间同步 I/O 的墙上时间。测试消费内核仓自己的 vDSO 探针，要求 "
"高精度模式验证成功后才测速；不能把不满足此门槛的数据作为吞吐结果。"
msgstr ""
"The acceptance VM uses 1 vCPU and 4 GiB of RAM, with invariant TSC "
"explicitly provided. The current kernel enables trusted high-resolution TSC "
"timing only on a single CPU; the PIT timing fallback on multiple CPUs may "
"undercount wall time during long synchronous I/O. The test uses the kernel "
"repository's own vDSO probe and runs benchmarks only after high-resolution "
"mode is verified. Data that fails this prerequisite must not be presented as"
" throughput results."

msgid "每项性能测试先预热一次，再测三次，输出原始纳秒样本、中位耗时与 MiB/s："
msgstr ""
"Each benchmark performs one warm-up run followed by three measured runs, "
"reporting raw nanosecond samples, median elapsed time, and MiB/s:"

msgid "``cat``：读取 32 MiB，写入 ``/dev/null``。"
msgstr "``cat``: read 32 MiB and write to ``/dev/null``."

msgid "``wc -l -w -c``：完整扫描 32 MiB，核对行数、单词数和字节数。"
msgstr ""
"``wc -l -w -c``: scan all 32 MiB and verify line, word, and byte counts."

msgid "``sha256sum``：对 32 MiB 文件计算并核对已知摘要。"
msgstr ""
"``sha256sum``: compute the hash of a 32 MiB file and verify it against a "
"known digest."

msgid "``tr a-z A-Z``：转换 32 MiB，写入 ``/dev/null``。"
msgstr "``tr a-z A-Z``: transform 32 MiB and write to ``/dev/null``."

msgid ""
"``sort``：排序 262144 行八位数字（2.25 MiB），写入 ``/dev/null``， 另对完整排序输出核对独立生成的有序数据摘要。"
msgstr ""
"``sort``: sort 262144 lines of eight-digit numbers (2.25 MiB) and write to "
"``/dev/null``; separately verify the digest of the complete sorted output "
"against independently generated sorted data."

msgid "``cp``：实际向 ext4 复制 1 MiB 文件，并逐字节比较副本。"
msgstr ""
"``cp``: actually copy a 1 MiB file to ext4 and compare the copy byte for "
"byte."

msgid ""
"``cat``、``tr``、``sort`` 另通过管道对完整输出做不计时的摘要校验，避免将文本 "
"处理测试变成额外的磁盘写入测试。复制使用较小的数据集，以适应当前文件系统同步刷新 成本；不为测速绕过系统持久化语义。测量包含进程启动与退出，输入经历 "
"预热，不清空系统缓存，也不要求每次复制强制落盘。因此它们是指定工作负载的 耗时与吞吐，不能当作冷盘速度、持久化写入速度或跨机器性能保证。报告应包含 "
"虚拟机平台、vCPU/内存、两种实现的编译优化级别及校验结果。"
msgstr ""
"``cat``, ``tr``, and ``sort`` also verify digests of their entire output "
"through pipes outside the timed runs, so text-processing tests do not become"
" additional disk-write tests. Copying uses a smaller dataset to accommodate "
"the current filesystem's synchronous flush cost; persistence semantics are "
"not bypassed for benchmarking. Measurements include process startup and "
"exit, use warmed input, do not clear system caches, and do not require each "
"copy to be forced to disk. They therefore describe elapsed time and "
"throughput for the specified workloads, not cold-disk speed, durable-write "
"speed, or a performance guarantee across machines. Reports should include "
"the VM platform, vCPU/memory, compilation optimization levels for both "
"implementations, and verification results."

msgid "真实签名 APK 的旧路径升级可单独验证::"
msgstr ""
"Legacy-path upgrades using real signed APKs can be verified separately::"

msgid ""
"此测试在宿主 Linux 用户命名空间的私有根目录内执行 APK 事务，仅证明包升级 和文件归属；系统内功能与测速必须以上述 ReliefOS "
"来宾运行结果为依据。"
msgstr ""
"This test runs APK transactions in a private root directory inside a host "
"Linux user namespace. It proves only package upgrades and file ownership; "
"in-system functionality and benchmarks must rely on the ReliefOS guest "
"results described above."
